{"toolCallId":"call_158edfc242e8499e899bb2aecad6f0b8","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"15:# Description: Detects unfilled spec-doc placeholders: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE:], [NEEDS_CLARIFICATION:] / [NEEDS CLARIFICATION:],\n16:#   and a [template:...] provenance token left in a title line. Bracketed authoring hints such as [Decision Title]\n19:#   [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: ...] token. While spec.md has the Status Draft, an unfilled token in such a doc is a\n33:carries_token_gate_stamp() {\n37:        grep -m1 -E '^[[:space:]]*<!--[[:space:]]*SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE:[^|>]*\\|[[:space:]]*v[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+[[:space:]]*-->' || true)\n71:    # These three are read only when they carry the token-gate stamp, so a doc\n76:    local -a draft_tokens=()\n103:        local token_gated=false\n104:        if carries_token_gate_stamp \"$filepath\"; then\n105:            token_gated=true\n109:                [[ \"$token_gated\" == true ]] || continue\n121:        # Pattern 1: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE:] (skip inline backticks)\n122:        # A token in a Draft packet is deferred to a warning when the doc carries\n123:        # the token-gate stamp and the line holds no open question.\n127:                if [[ \"$token_gated\" == true && \"$draft_packet\" == true ]] && \\\n128:                   ! printf '%s' \"$match\" | grep -qE '\\[NEEDS[_ ]CLARIFICATION:'; then\n129:                    draft_tokens+=(\"$file:$linenum\")\n134:        done < <(echo \"$filtered\" | grep -E '\\[YOUR_VALUE_HERE:' 2>/dev/null | \\\n135:                 grep -v '`\\[YOUR_VALUE_HERE:' | \\\n136:                 grep -v '\\[YOUR_VALUE_HERE:[^]]*\\]`' || true)\n145:        done < <(echo \"$filtered\" | grep -E '\\[NEEDS[_ ]CLARIFICATION:' 2>/dev/null | \\\n146:                 grep -v '`\\[NEEDS[_ ]CLARIFICATION:' | \\\n147:                 grep -v '\\[NEEDS[_ ]CLARIFICATION:[^]]*\\]`' || true)\n149:        # Pattern 3: a template's [template:...] provenance token left in a title.\n158:        done < <(echo \"$filtered\" | grep -E '^[0-9]+:[[:space:]]*title:.*\\[template:' 2>/dev/null || true)\n173:    local -a unique_draft_tokens=()\n175:    if [[ ${#draft_tokens[@]} -gt 0 ]]; then\n176:        for item in \"${draft_tokens[@]}\"; do\n179:                unique_draft_tokens+=(\"$item\")\n189:    local draft_count=${#unique_draft_tokens[@]}\n195:        RULE_REMEDIATION=\"Replace [YOUR_VALUE_HERE:] and [NEEDS_CLARIFICATION:] / [NEEDS CLARIFICATION:] with actual values\"\n198:        RULE_MESSAGE=\"Found $draft_count unfilled value token(s) in a Draft packet\"\n199:        RULE_DETAILS=(\"${unique_draft_tokens[@]}\")\n200:        RULE_REMEDIATION=\"Replace each [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: ...] token with actual content before the status leaves Draft\"\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/224-deepseek-final2","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"0190fb","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
